// ────────────── Output Configuration ──────────────
// You can run `niri msg outputs` to get the correct name for your displays.
// https://github.com/YaLTeR/niri/wiki/Configuration:-Outputs
// Matched by connector name (DP-4) so the monitor's serial number stays out of this public repo.
// If the monitor moves to another port, change the name here.

output "DP-4" {
    scale 1.5
}
